1
00:00:00,306 --> 00:00:03,056
(Leonard:)I'll send them a basket of muffins.

2
00:00:03,976 --> 00:00:08,646
(Howard:)Now, inside we've got motion detectors,
infrared sensors...

3
00:00:08,814 --> 00:00:11,354
(Howard:)...and cameras connected to a server...

4
00:00:11,525 --> 00:00:14,315
(Howard:)...running state-of-the-art
facial-recognition software.

5
00:00:14,487 --> 00:00:16,197
(Leonard:)Where did you get all this stuff?

6
00:00:16,364 --> 00:00:19,034
(Howard:)I got a buddy over at
the Department of Defense.

7
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:23,700
(Leonard:)-He just gave it to you?
-I'm sure he would've if I'd asked.

8
00:00:23,871 --> 00:00:27,001
(Howard:)Ironically, their security isn't
all that good.

9
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,130
(Penny(entering):)Raj, your car is blocking me.

10
00:00:29,293 --> 00:00:30,543
[ALARM WAILING]

11
00:00:30,711 --> 00:00:32,091
VOICE:
Intruder alert. Intruder alert.

12
00:00:32,254 --> 00:00:33,334
(Penny(entering):)-Intruder alert.
-What the hell?

13
00:00:33,506 --> 00:00:35,836
(Leonard:)-Sorry, let me help you.
-Intruder alert.

14
00:00:36,008 --> 00:00:40,508
(Sheldon:)Wonderful security system if
we're attacked by a school of tuna.

15
00:00:40,680 --> 00:00:43,010
(Man on TV:)Don't worry,
the net's gonna be electrified.

16
00:00:43,182 --> 00:00:46,522
(Howard:)Picture her on the floor,
spasming uncontrollably.

17
00:00:48,187 --> 00:00:50,357
(Sheldon:)Better.

18
00:00:51,857 --> 00:00:53,857
SHELDON [IN VOICE-OVER]:
Sheldon's journal.

19
00:00:54,026 --> 00:00:58,906
(Sheldon:)Security system in place.
However, sleep continues to elude me.

20
00:00:59,073 --> 00:01:03,023
(Sheldon:)I've seen the underbelly of Pasadena...

